You think of meeting up with Princess Darlyne once more, especially as you have just gained important pieces of information from your last conversation with Rea. However, you soon discover that she is still too busy with her own paperworks.

Though she appreciates you going out of your way to look for her, but it would still take another hour or two before she is available.

[? if not visit_if_seen: Perhaps there are other, better things that could be done. ?] [? if visit_if_seen: Is going home really the only option left now? ?]

@visit_if
