As you consider your options, you get reminded that it *has* been quite a while since you visited the Imperial Forum.

When you are already a short distance away from the Imperial Forum's building, however, you see that it is crowded outside. *Very* crowded, in fact. You can hear several passersby in front of you wonder about what could the meeting have been like that the Forum is still closed "*even after those people have been going back-and-forth inside for several hours*".

[? if not visit_dadar_seen: Perhaps there are other, better things that could be done. ?] [? if visit_dadar_seen: Is going home really the only option left now? ?]

